{"sha": "28f47ca036e0413b04e42721535f1df6b21288a7ecf305234b99005b037cbc80", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}[圆轨道]\\label{thm:b1:central-forces:circular}", "\\index{轨道速率}\\index{开普勒第三定律}", "在半径为 $r$、绕质量为 $M$ 的天体运行的圆轨道上：", "\\[", "v = \\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{r}}, \\qquad", "T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{r^3}{GM}}, \\qquad", "E_m = -\\frac{GMm}{2r} = -E_k = \\tfrac12 E_p .", "\\]", "特别地，对同一中心的所有圆轨道，$T^2/r^3 = 4\\pi^2/GM$ 是相同的", "（开普勒第三定律）。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "匀速圆周运动需要向心力 $mv^2/r = GMm/r^2$；", "$T = 2\\pi r/v$；$E_k = \\tfrac12 mv^2 = GMm/2r$ 及 $E_p = -GMm/r$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[三种轨道]\\label{ex:b1:central-forces:orbits}", "$GM_\\oplus = \\qty{3.99e14}{m^3/s^2}$。低轨道（$r = \\qty{6770}{km}$，", "高出地面 \\qty{400}{km}）：$v = \\qty{7.7}{km/s}$，$T = \\qty{92}{min}$。地球静止轨道", "（$T = \\qty{86164}{s}$，一个恒星日）：$r = (GMT^2/4\\pi^2)^{1/3} =", "\\qty{42200}{km}$，$v = \\qty{3.1}{km/s}$。月球（$r = \\qty{384000}{km}$）：", "$T = \\qty{27.4}{d}$ --- 其向心加速度 $v^2/r =", "\\qty{2.7e-3}{m/s^2}$，在六十个地球半径处恰为 $g/3600$：平方反比", "律，由牛顿本人检验。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{开普勒定律与轨道形状}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[牛顿场中的轨迹]\\label{thm:b1:central-forces:conics}", "\\index{开普勒定律}\\index{圆锥曲线}\\index{椭圆（轨道）}\\index{偏心率}", "固定质量 $M$ 的场中，物体的轨迹为圆锥曲线，", "且 $O$ 位于其一个焦点上：$E_m < 0$ 时为椭圆，$E_m = 0$ 时为抛物线，", "$E_m > 0$ 时为双曲线。对于半长轴为 $a$ 的椭圆，", "偏心率为 $e$：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item （开普勒第一定律）力心位于焦点上；近心点和远心点", "        分别位于 $r_p = a(1 - e)$ 和 $r_a = a(1 + e)$；", "  \\item （开普勒第二定律）面速度守恒（即面积定律）；", "  \\item （开普勒第三定律）周期满足 $T^2 = 4\\pi^2a^3/GM$；", "  \\item 能量仅取决于 $a$，即 $E_m = -GMm/2a$，于是", "        距离为 $r$ 处的速率由下式给出：", "        \\[", "        v^2 = GM\\left(\\frac{2}{r} - \\frac{1}{a}\\right) .", "        \\]", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{remark}[已证明与承认的内容]\\label{rem:b1:central-forces:admitted}", "开普勒第二定律与能量分类已在上文证明。关于", "束缚轨道恰为以 $O$ 为焦点的椭圆，连同开普勒第三定律，", "以及一般情形下的 $E_m = -GMm/2a$，需要对径向方程进行积分", "（本科二年级分册中完成）；对圆轨道（$a = r$，", "$e = 0$），各结论都归结为\\cref{thm:b1:central-forces:circular}，", "这正是此处可作的检验。关系式 $v^2 = GM(2/r - 1/a)$", "在承认该能量公式的前提下，", "由 $E_m = \\tfrac12 mv^2 - GMm/r = -GMm/2a$ 可得。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  % ellipse a=3, e=0.6, c=1.8, b=2.4 ; focus O at origin ; center at (-1.8,0)", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (-1.8,0) ellipse (3 and 2.4);", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.8pt) node[below] {$O$};", "  \\fill (-3.6,0) circle (1.2pt) node[below] {$O'$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (-4.8,0) -- (1.2,0);", "  \\fill[omThm] (1.2,0) circle (1.6pt) node[below right] {$P$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (-4.8,0) circle (1.6pt) node[below left] {$A$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omExo] (-1.8,-2.6) -- (1.2,-2.6) node[midway, below] {$a$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omExo] (-1.8,0.1) -- (-1.8,2.4) node[midway, left] {$b$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omExo] (-1.8,0.45) -- (0,0.45) node[midway, above] {$c = ea$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.7,0.8) {$r_p = a(1 - e)$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (-3.4,0.8) {$r_a = a(1 + e)$};", "  % hyperbola and parabola sketches on the right", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.3cm]", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.8pt) node[below] {$O$};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, domain=-1.55:1.55, samples=80, variable=\\t] plot ({1.0*cosh(\\t)-1.6},{1.2*sinh(\\t)});", "  \\draw[omExo, thick, domain=-2.4:2.4, samples=80, variable=\\y] plot ({0.5*\\y*\\y-2.6},{\\y});", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.0,2.9) {$E_m > 0$};", "  \\node[omExo, font=\\footnotesize] at (-2.2,2.9) {$E_m = 0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：绕焦点 $O$ 运行的椭圆轨道 --- 半长轴", "$a$，半短轴 $b$，焦距 $c = ea$；物体在", "近心点 $P$ 处速率最大，远心点 $A$ 处速率最小。右图：双曲线（正能量）与", "抛物线（零能量），二者绕同一焦点 --- 即", "彗星与探测器的非束缚轨道。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[哈雷彗星]\\label{ex:b1:central-forces:halley}", "近日点 \\qty{0.586}{AU}，远日点 \\qty{35.1}{AU}：$a = \\qty{17.8}{AU}$，", "$e = 0.967$，$T = \\sqrt{17.8^3} = \\qty{75}{years}$（开普勒第三定律以", "天文单位和年为单位表示，其中对太阳有 $T^2 = a^3$）。", "取 $GM_\\odot = \\qty{1.33e20}{m^3/s^2}$，则近日点速率为", "$\\sqrt{GM(2/r_p - 1/a)} = \\qty{54}{km/s}$，远日点处为 \\qty{0.9}{km/s}", "--- 慢六十倍，符合面积定律的要求（$r_pv_p = r_av_a$）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{卫星}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[逃逸速度；地球静止轨道]\\label{prop:b1:central-forces:escape}", "\\index{逃逸速度}\\index{地球静止轨道}", "从质量为 $M$、半径为 $R$ 的天体表面出发，使物体到达无穷远的", "最小发射速率为 $v_e = \\sqrt{2GM/R} = \\sqrt2\\,v_c$，", "其中 $v_c = \\sqrt{GM/R}$ 为地面处的圆轨道速率：", "对地球而言为 \\qty{11.2}{km/s}。\\emph{地球静止}卫星在赤道面内绕行，", "周期等于地球的恒星日，轨道位于", "$r = \\qty{42200}{km}$ 处（距地面 \\qty{35800}{km}）。", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}